    sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/868a3efa0d3c2ec44ebee02d65905e37/af1fa/boo-etry-flyer.jpg\"\n            alt=\"The Boo-etry Flyer\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><strong>The Boo-etry — A Spooky, Ghostly, Eerie Celebration</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Friday, October 30, 2026, 7–9 p.m.</strong></p>\n<p>Aronos Research Club, 37 Elkin Street, Sonora, CA 95370</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Blanche Abrams to read Poe’s <em>The Raven</em></li>\n<li>Featured guests to perform either famous literary or poetic works or their own poetry and prose. If you’d like to be a featured guest, submissions should be emailed to <a href=\"mailto:amy.luning@gmail.com\">amy.luning@gmail.com</a> or <a href=\"mailto:blanchelabrams@gmail.com\">blanchelabrams@gmail.com</a></li>\n<li>Open mic for original poetry/prose</li>\n<li>This event is for adults and older kids ten and up</li>\n<li>There will be candy and treats, but no trick-or-treating</li>\n<li>This is a Halloween-centric event</li>\n<li>Costumes? Yes please. I shall dust off my bat wings</li>\n<li>Adults $5, Kids $3 — at the door</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/b9710/blanche-raven.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 182.91139240506325%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/18dfc/blanche-raven.webp 158w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/30002/blanche-raven.webp 315w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/e59cf/blanche-raven.webp 630w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/9d58c/blanche-raven.webp 876w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/ab180/blanche-raven.jpg 158w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/ba98e/blanche-raven.jpg 315w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/af1fa/blanche-raven.jpg 630w,\n/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/b9710/blanche-raven.jpg 876w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n            type=\"image/jpeg\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/f3fcbdd35ac72f260ac1bbf61407ab8d/af1fa/blanche-raven.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Blanche Abrams as the Raven\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><em>Blanche Abrams as the Raven. Photo by Creasie Jordan.</em></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"The Boo-etry: A Spooky, Ghostly, Eerie Celebration — October 30th","date":"October 30, 2026","description":"The Sonora Writers Group hosts The Boo-etry, a spooky, ghostly, eerie celebration on Friday, October 30th from 7 to 9 p.m. Featuring Blanche Abrams reading Poe's The Raven, featured guests, and an open mic for original poetry and prose. Costumes encouraged! Adults $5, kids $3 at the door."}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/events/sep-12-fotcl-book-sellers-event/"},"frontma